        "paragraphIndex": 74,
        "offsetUnit": "Unicode code points",
        "offsetConvention": "zero-based, end-exclusive",
        "start": 1490,
        "end": 1608,
        "quote": "符合条件的申请者需登录“厦门大学境外学生网上报名系统”（http://application.xmu.edu.cn）完成网上报名并上传《厦门大学国际学生新生奖学金申请表》扫描件（须用中文或英文填写，并附本人签名）。无需邮寄纸质申请材料。",
        "quoteSha256": "5aecd26807f867bcf4e983766cda78ee67a69db2e04fa6db9f6e4336f4ff42e8",
        "objectKey": "official/coverage-pilot-20261118/8e551110516ec05b9efe59fbd86ef4a05135512445934a0d6a208db767bd7a3d.html"
      },
